[
    {
        "content": "<p>I noticed a small paper cut when using <code>mvcgen</code>, and wonder if it can easily be addressed. <br>\nConsider the following sketch of a proof over a <code>while</code> loop in <code>StateM</code> using <code>mvcgen</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">version</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- Lean v4.32.0</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">State</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">StateM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">State</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">while</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"bp\">⌜</span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"bp\">⌝</span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"bp\">⇓_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌜</span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"bp\">⌝</span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mvcgen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inv1</span><span class=\"w\">             </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- termination measure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inv2</span><span class=\"w\">             </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- loop invariant</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vc1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inst</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- ?</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vc2</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isTrue</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vc3</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isFalse</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vc4</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The subgoal <code>vc1.inst</code> requires us to provide an instance <code>Lean.Order.MonadTail (StateM State)</code>. Changing this code to use <code>Nat</code> directly instead of the wrapping <code>State</code> type removes this subgoal. The problem is the following:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Order</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MonadTail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">StateM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- success</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Order</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MonadTail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">StateM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">State</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- failure</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The reason for this seems to be that synthesizing a <code>MonadTail</code> instance for <code>StateM</code> requires the state type to be <code>Nonempty</code>. So adding <code>deriving instance Nonempty for State</code> actually resolves the issue above.</p>\n<p>I'm guessing this must be a common use case, so is it possible that this <code>Nonempty</code> instance could be (attempted to be) derived by <code>mvcgen</code>/<code>vcgen</code> automatically?</p>\n<p>cc <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"130195\">@Sebastian Graf</span></p>",
        "id": 613831168,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcus Rossel",
        "timestamp": 1785493645
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Hmm, I don't really see how <code>mvcgen</code> could derive the instance, and why it would do so specifically for <code>Nonempty</code>. Would it help if <code>mvcgen</code> would simply fail instead, reporting that it could not synthesize the instance necessary to apply <code>while</code>'s spec?</p>",
        "id": 613860927,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Graf",
        "timestamp": 1785504786
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Perhaps I'm overestimating how common this is, but I just thought that it's probably a very common case to use <code>StateM</code> with a<code>State</code> structure. And in that case, users will always have to derive (or define) a <code>Nonempty State</code> instance. And at least for me, this was not at all clear when seeing the <code>MonadTail (StateM State)</code> obligation initially. <br>\nI'm not sure how <code>deriving</code> handlers work, but my guess would have been that they could be invoked somewhat easily. But perhaps it's not a good idea to derive instances on the fly, and this should indeed rather be surfaced to the user.</p>",
        "id": 613871081,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcus Rossel",
        "timestamp": 1785507800
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yeah, I was also really confused when I saw the instance obligation before reading the rest of your message. Sadly, I'm a loss at what we can do here. Maybe instance search should warn when it had to reject an instance because of a missing <code>Nonempty</code> instance? I think a lack of that is <em>almost</em> always a bug on the user's behalf</p>",
        "id": 613871559,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Graf",
        "timestamp": 1785507907
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"130195\">Sebastian Graf</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/mvcgen.3A.20Order.2EMonadTail/near/613860927\">said</a> in <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"113488\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/mvcgen.3A.20Order.2EMonadTail/with/613871926\">#general &gt; mvcgen: Order.MonadTail</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Would it help if <code>mvcgen</code> would simply fail instead, reporting that it could not synthesize the instance necessary to apply <code>while</code>'s spec?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I think this would have been helpful to me. The <code>vc1.inst</code> subgoal pushed me in the direction of trying to figure out what kind of proof obligation this was. And an error message might have made it more clear that something's missing.</p>",
        "id": 613871715,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcus Rossel",
        "timestamp": 1785507948
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"130195\">Sebastian Graf</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/mvcgen.3A.20Order.2EMonadTail/near/613871559\">said</a> in <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"113488\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/mvcgen.3A.20Order.2EMonadTail/with/613871715\">#general &gt; mvcgen: Order.MonadTail</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Maybe instance search should warn when it had to reject an instance because of a missing <code>Nonempty</code> instance? I think a lack of that is <em>almost</em> always a bug on the user's behalf</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Is it easy to detect that a missing <code>Nonempty</code> instance is the reason? If that's possible that would be great!</p>",
        "id": 613871926,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcus Rossel",
        "timestamp": 1785508013
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I mean one option would also be to omit the <code>Nonempty</code> assumption. It still works as</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Monad</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonadTail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">MonadTail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StateT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">instCCPO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">letI</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CCPO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">instCCPOPi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">haveI</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">MonadTail</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instCCPO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">inferInstanceAs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">CCPO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"o\">)))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">bind_mono_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">show</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">StateT</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">StateT</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">StateT</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MonadTail</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bind_mono_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s'</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s'</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>even if it's a bit more cumbersome.</p>",
